    "group": "Brood Brothers Auxilia",
    "summary": "Whenever an **ASTRA MILITARUM** unit of yours is picked to shoot, you may pick one enemy unit visible to it and within 18\". Until the phase ends:\n\n- The shooting unit's models can target only that enemy, and only while it remains a legal target.\n- That enemy counts as caught in overlapping fire.\n\nRanged attacks by your **GENESTEALER CULTS** models against a unit caught in overlapping fire get +1 to their Hit rolls.",
